```wireframe
board "Notes States"
  screen phone "Empty"
    navbar "Notes" leading=menu
    stack column padding=20 gap=24 align=center justify=center grow
      image height=120 label="Illustration"
      text "No notes yet" bold size=lg align=center
      text "Create your first note to get started" align=center muted
      button label="Create note" variant=primary
  screen phone "Error"
    navbar "Notes" leading=menu
    stack column padding=20 gap=24 align=center justify=center grow
      image height=120 label="Error"
      text "Something went wrong" bold size=lg align=center
      text "We couldn't load your notes. Please try again." align=center muted
      button label="Retry" variant=primary
```